      "title": "How to use this template",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## WaveSpeed AI — Universal Generation node\n\nThis template uses the **WaveSpeedAI Predictor** node, a single node that can call any of the 600+ models hosted on WaveSpeed AI (image, video, audio, 3D, ...).\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the custom node: **Manager → Custom Nodes Manager → \"WaveSpeed AI - Universal Generation\"** (registry id `wavespeed-comfyui`).\n2. Get an API key at [wavespeed.ai](https://wavespeed.ai) (free tier available).\n3. In ComfyUI: **Settings → WaveSpeed → API Key**, paste the key, then reload the page.\n\n> The first load after adding a key fetches the model catalog once (5-10s). After that, model and parameter lists are instant.\n\n### Using this workflow\nPick a different model straight from the node - the parameter fields rebuild themselves for that model, so the rest of the graph keeps working.\n\n[Node repository](https://github.com/WaveSpeedAI/wavespeed-comfyui) · [Docs](https://wavespeed.ai/docs)"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
